Grok Build Markdown components
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

ElecKoi links the `xai-grok-markdown` and `xai-grok-markdown-core` crates from
https://github.com/xai-org/grok-build at pinned commit
98c3b2438aa922fbbe6178a5c0a4c48f85edc8ce. ElecKoi adapts
their headless parsing output to JNI-safe payloads and the Android/Compose
document model.

Grok Build first-party code is licensed under Apache-2.0. The applicable
license text and generated Rust dependency notices are included in:

- runtime/licenses/Apache-2.0.txt
- app/src/main/assets/licenses/rust-markdown-third-party-notices.html

The linked Mermaid implementation and its ancestry retain their own notices in
app/src/main/rust/vendor/mermaid-to-svg/.

